CharacterBERT source code and pretrained medical-model resources used by the
study were downloaded from:

https://github.com/helboukkouri/character-bert

CharacterBERT model and character-indexing components in src/drug_spelling were
adapted from that repository, which accompanies:

Hicham El Boukkouri et al. "CharacterBERT: Reconciling ELMo and BERT for
Word-Level Open-Vocabulary Representations From Characters." COLING 2020.
https://aclanthology.org/2020.coling-main.609/

Those components also contain code adapted from Hugging Face Transformers and
AllenNLP. The original code in this release is provided under the MIT License
in LICENSE. Third-party-derived components remain subject to their upstream
terms. Consult the upstream projects for their notices.

The pretrained BioWordVec embeddings used by the study were downloaded from
the NCBI BioSentVec/BioWordVec repository:

https://github.com/ncbi-nlp/BioSentVec

The BioWordVec embedding file is not redistributed in this release. Consult
the upstream repository and associated publication for its terms and citation.
